# Outfit body: long trench coat with an accent belt and collar (R23). V5.5: shaped, not a slab: an octagonal torso
# around the mannequin (wide enough to stay outside the body), a belt, a flared skirt split at the front, and a
# turned-up collar. Hollow.
# Regridded to 5 cm voxels (R1 floor, CP7).
name outfit_trench
grid 5
size 9 11 14
slot coat SwatchMain
slot belt SwatchAccent
# Torso: chamfered octagon around the chest.
poly 6 13 coat 0,2 2,1 7,1 8,2 8,8 7,10 2,10 0,8
# Skirt: wider at the hem, stepped out one voxel per band (a voxel flare).
poly 0 3 coat 0,1 1,0 8,0 9,1 9,9 8,10 1,10 0,9
poly 2 6 coat 0,2 2,0 7,0 8,2 8,9 7,10 2,10 0,9
# Belt between them, one voxel proud.
poly 5 7 belt 0,2 2,0 7,0 9,2 9,9 7,10 2,10 0,9
# Collar: a turned-up ring above the shoulders.
poly 12 14 coat 1,2 2,1 6,1 8,2 8,8 6,9 2,9 1,8
# Hollow it: the mannequin stands inside.
carve poly 0 5 1,2 2,1 6,1 8,2 8,8 6,9 2,9 1,8
carve poly 6 12 1,3 2,2 6,2 8,3 8,8 6,9 2,9 1,8
carve poly 13 13 2,3 3,2 6,2 7,3 7,7 6,8 3,8 2,7
# Open front below the belt, and a V at the neck.
carve box 8 5 0 8 6 5
carve box 7 4 12 8 6 13
# Belt buckle.
box 8 4 5 9 6 7 belt
pivot 4 5 3
